This is a faceless cinematic journey in a fixed five-beat format (POV sprint + door shove in one continuous motion, POV walk the interior threshold to the top of a straight staircase going down, POV continuously descend, OFF-POV lateral tracking across a hidden luxury interior with the traveler walking calmly in one direction, OFF-POV follow into another luxurious room). Honor the camera mode of this scene: scenes 1-3 are first-person POV (raw body-cam/GoPro/handheld footage at chest/eye level, slightly imperfect framing, body never visible except S1 arms swinging in the lower frame and the door-shoving hand at end-of-S1, and a possible brief hand on a side-wall railing in S3); scenes 4-5 are calm off-POV third-person in which the traveler is seen only from behind or in profile, face never shown, clothing locked across S4 and S5. The descent is always a normal short straight step staircase going down, structurally attached, in an enclosed stairwell with no outdoor window, with any handrail on the side wall only. Keep the locked structure identity through the exterior portions. The image must advance the journey only a believable short step from the previous keyframe. No on-screen text, numbers, logos, or watermarks. Single continuous frame only.

motion.prompt_template:
{kling_prompt}

This is a faceless cinematic journey in a fixed five-beat format toward and into a hidden luxurious secret living space. Honor the camera mode stated for this scene. SCENES 1-3 FIRST-PERSON POV (body-cam/GoPro/handheld): animate authentic POV motion appropriate to the moment. Scene 1: the camera is a BODY-CAM on a PANICKED sprinting runner FLEEING on a non-linear weaving path — EXTREME footstep bob (camera jolts DOWN-UP AND side-to-side with each footfall, 3–4 strides per second flat-out sprint, frame rotates 8–15 degrees per stride, motion blur at frame edges), panicked panting breath, head turning to scan and glancing over the shoulder backwards (camera NOT always pointed at the destination door — the door enters and exits the frame), arms/hands swinging in and out of the bottom of the frame, AND at the end of the clip the hand SHOVES the door open INWARD fast in one motion and the runner barges through into the interior. The door is a real rigid solid body that swings inward as the hand pushes it — it never opens outward toward the camera, never opens slowly, never vanishes/dissolves/warps. Scene 2: a hurried purposeful POV walk through the structure's interior threshold to the top of the descending staircase, reduced bob, still handheld, ending at the top looking DOWN. Scene 3: continuous POV descent of a short structurally-attached straight step staircase from top to bottom, step-by-step bob, the camera NEVER lifts off the head, NEVER cuts to third-person, NEVER skips ahead. SCENES 4-5 OFF-POV THIRD-PERSON: calm controlled motion. Scene 4: a slow horizontal lateral tracking shot across the room while the traveler (from behind, face never shown) walks calmly in ONE consistent forward direction; interior locked, person appearance locked. Scene 5: a smooth continuous follow from behind as the traveler walks through into another luxurious room with same materials/palette; person appearance IDENTICAL to S4.

Keep the locked structure identity through the exterior portions. Advance the journey only a believable short distance per clip. The descent is always a normal short straight step staircase going DOWN, structurally attached — never a ladder, never floating, never climbing up. The stairwell is fully enclosed with no outdoor window. Any handrail is on the side wall only. The audio is natural diegetic sound only that matches the action exactly — wind/sea/rain plus HARD pounding footsteps on the SPECIFIC ground surface and panting breath (S1), brisk footsteps on the SPECIFIC interior floor material (S2), footsteps on the SPECIFIC staircase material (S3), calm walking footsteps on the SPECIFIC interior floor material (S4-S5) — absolutely NO music or score. Every clip must depict ONE continuous motion from start to end — no time jumps, no mid-clip cuts, no skipping; in S4 and S5 the person walks in ONE consistent direction without turning, reversing, walking backwards, melting, or changing appearance.
